# haiku-pi: fluidlite, glu, libogg, libvorbis, mesa (and their _devel) are ours, built by the
# coordination repository's scripts/package-gl-stack.sh and scripts/package-port.py and staged in
# download/; a build needs -sHAIKU_NO_DOWNLOADS=1, as Haiku's servers do not have them. The "any"
# packages without _bootstrap are the x86_64 repository's (scripts/fetch-any-packages.sh).
